{"id":"7480655210b09b5d","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-deduction.md","title":"Deduction","display":"df-deduction — Deduction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-deduction","aliases":["93-df-deduction"],"display":"df-deduction — Deduction","depends_on":["[[93-df-proof]]","[[93-df-consequence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-deduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-deduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-deduction — Deduction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4e0a05ab276dc277\" href=\"?note=4e0a05ab276dc277\" title=\"93-df-proof\">93-df-proof</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"afd7605d365be7b6\" href=\"?note=afd7605d365be7b6\" title=\"93-df-consequence\">93-df-consequence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathcal P\\)</span> is a deductive-calculus candidate; its formula carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> is recovered from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Calc}_{93}(\\mathcal P;F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Calc}_{93}(\\mathcal P;F)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_{93}(p,\\varphi,\\mathcal P,\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Proof}_{93}(p,\\varphi,\\mathcal P,\\Gamma)\\)</span> is the four-place proof predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4e0a05ab276dc277\" href=\"?note=4e0a05ab276dc277\" title=\"93-df-proof\">93-df-proof</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ded}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ded}_{93}\\)</span> is the derivability predicate defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deduction}\\vdash \\mathrm{Ded}_{93}(\\Gamma,\\varphi,\\mathcal P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists F\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Calc}_{93}(\\mathcal P;F)\\land\n\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\land\\varphi\\in F\\land\n\\exists p\\;\\mathrm{Proof}_{93}(p,\\varphi,\\mathcal P,\\Gamma)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deduction}\\vdash \\mathrm{Ded}_{93}(\\Gamma,\\varphi,\\mathcal P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists F\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Calc}_{93}(\\mathcal P;F)\\land\n\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\land\\varphi\\in F\\land\n\\exists p\\;\\mathrm{Proof}_{93}(p,\\varphi,\\mathcal P,\\Gamma)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The calculus and premise set occupy distinct arguments, while the calculus tuple uniquely determines the bound formula carrier. A derived consequence relation may be introduced by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ded}_{93}(\\Gamma,\\varphi,\\mathcal P)\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ded}_{93}(\\Gamma,\\varphi,\\mathcal P)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-proof","status":"resolved","id":"4e0a05ab276dc277","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"afd7605d365be7b6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-consequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-proof","status":"resolved","id":"4e0a05ab276dc277","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Proof}_{93}(p,\\varphi,\\mathcal P,\\Gamma)$ is the four-place proof predicate of [[93-df-proof]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal P","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Calc}_{93}(\\mathcal P;F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Proof}_{93}(p,\\varphi,\\mathcal P,\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ded}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deduction}\\vdash \\mathrm{Ded}_{93}(\\Gamma,\\varphi,\\mathcal P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists F\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Calc}_{93}(\\mathcal P;F)\\land\n\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\land\\varphi\\in F\\land\n\\exists p\\;\\mathrm{Proof}_{93}(p,\\varphi,\\mathcal P,\\Gamma)\\Bigr]","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ded}_{93}(\\Gamma,\\varphi,\\mathcal P)","display":false}],"bytes":1140,"backlinks":[{"id":"e3c8f5c9e577b791","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ba86732612230e2a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"af4bf41c645962b1","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["4e0a05ab276dc277","afd7605d365be7b6"]}